    vendor_says_open: "Ubicloud's live pricing documentation, read 2026-08-22, states that all new users get premium runners BY DEFAULT and may disable premium in account settings to use standard runners instead. That is an opt-out default, not a withdrawal.",
    settle_by: "Create a fresh account and read the offered tiers. Until then neither reading may be asserted: both are first-party, they contradict, and picking the convenient one is choosing a fact rather than observing it.",
  },
